> Or we could just silently change the types, because we, strictly speaking, never (to my knowledge) explicitly promised to use the docker/distribution types… fine, but then we should not make the same mistake again and actually define c/image-specific error types for the conditions callers care about;

I think this would make the most sense, bumping to v6 does not seem reasonable and keeping some outdated module forever also seem not that great even if we just use it for basic types.

But I agree it is certainly not urgent
